---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';import Picture from '../components/Picture.astro';import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our Story | Dawat Family Restaurant, Tanuku" description="Meet Dawat, a family dining destination in Tanuku from the team behind Star Bawarchi. A place for food, family, flavour and hospitality."><PageHero eyebrow="FOOD IS ONLY THE BEGINNING" title="More Than" italic="a Meal" description="A place to come together. A reason to stay a little longer."/><section class="container story-grid story-page-intro section-space"><div class="story-image" data-reveal><Picture name="table"/></div><div class="story-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">OUR BEGINNING</p><h2>From the Team<br/>Behind<br/><em>Star Bawarchi</em></h2><p>Dawat Family Restaurant was created by the team behind Star Bawarchi in Tanuku. The idea is simple: a family dining destination where the meal and the time spent together both matter.</p><p>You’ll find us at Rajiv Chowk on Velpur Road, ready to welcome you to the table.</p></div></section><section class="values-section section-space"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">WHY DAWAT</p><h2>Four things.<br/><em>One shared table.</em></h2><div class="values-grid">{[{name:'Food',copy:'From signature biryanis to comforting curries, there’s plenty to bring to the table.'},{name:'Family',copy:'A meal is a chance to pause, catch up and spend time with your people.'},{name:'Flavour',copy:'Indian favourites, bold starters and a cup of Irani chai to round it all off.'},{name:'Hospitality',copy:'Come in, settle down and make yourself at home over a meal.'}].map((v,i)=><div data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">0{i+1}</span><h3>{v.name}</h3><p>{v.copy}</p></div>)}</div></div></section><section class="container centred-story section-space" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">A RESTAURANT BUILT AROUND THE TABLE</p><h2>The best part of a meal?<br/><em>Who you share it with.</em></h2><p>A family lunch. A catch-up over chai. Dinner after a long day. Dawat makes space for the ordinary moments that become the ones you remember.</p><div class="story-wide-image"><Picture name="ambience" sizes="100vw"/><span class="ambience-disclaimer">Illustrative dining ambience</span></div><p class="eyebrow">DAWAT TODAY</p><h3>Your gathering place in Tanuku.</h3><p>Visit us for family dining, explore our menu, or bring Dawat to your table with online ordering through Zomato.</p></section><CTASection title="Come be part of the story." text="We’ll see you at Rajiv Chowk, Tanuku." primary="Visit Dawat" href="/contact/"/></BaseLayout>
